# NexusAI vs Oracle Fusion: Module-by-Module Parity Assessment
## PART 3: Human Capital Management (HCM) Suite
*Page / Form / Field / Granular Level Comparison*

Legend: ✅ = Exists in NexusAI | ⚠️ = Partial / Simplified | ❌ = Missing entirely

---

## Module 18 — Core Human Resources (Global HR)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Global Human Resources Cloud

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [HR.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/HR.tsx) — Core HR landing
- ✅ [EmployeeDirectory.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/EmployeeDirectory.tsx) (2.7KB)
- ✅ [OrgChart.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/OrgChart.tsx)
- ✅ `hr/` sub-directory — **49 pages** (most comprehensive HR section)
- ✅ [HRReports.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/HRReports.tsx) (8.2KB) / [HRAnalyticsDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/HRAnalyticsDashboard.tsx) (10.3KB)
- ✅ [Attendance.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/Attendance.tsx) / [AttendanceDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/AttendanceDashboard.tsx)
- ✅ [OnboardingAutomation.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/OnboardingAutomation.tsx)
- ✅ Schemas: [hr_worker.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/hr_worker.ts), [hr_structures.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/hr_structures.ts), [hr_compliance.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/hr_compliance.ts), [hr_delegation.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/hr_delegation.ts)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Hire Flow (New Person Wizard)** | ⚠️ Partial | HR pages exist. Missing: Oracle's guided transaction flow that creates Person → Work Relationship → Assignment → Pay as a multi-step wizard with validation. |
| **DateTrack (Effective Dating on all forms)** | ❌ **CRITICAL** | Oracle routes every change (department, salary, title) through "When does this take effect?" UI. Any backdated or future-dated changes create a new effective-dated row. Nexus has no effective dating architecture. |
| **Assignment Form (Full Oracle)** | ⚠️ Partial | Basic assignment exists. Oracle's Assignment form has: Grade, Step, Grade Ladder, Probation End Date, Working Hours, Full-Time/Part-Time indicator, Manager (with DateTrack). |
| **Manager Self-Service (MSS) Guided Transactions** | ❌ Missing | Managers access guided flows: "Transfer," "Change Working Hours," "Request Promotion" — all routing through AME approval. |
| **Employment Contracts** | ⚠️ Partial | Document management exists. Missing: Contract type, start/end date, renewal alert, jurisdiction-specific fields. |
| **Position Management** | ⚠️ Partial | Structures schema exists. Missing: Position budgeting (FTE budget vs. actual), Position sync (changes cascade to incumbent Assignment). |
| **HR Help Desk (Journeys / HR Service Delivery)** | ⚠️ Partial | [ServiceRequestPortal.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ServiceRequestPortal.tsx) exists generically. Missing: HR-specific "Journey" templates (onboarding journey, life event flows, offboarding checklist). |
| **Person Spotlight View** | ❌ Missing | Oracle's 360° person view that shows employment data, compensation history, performance ratings, and absence all in one page. |
| **Seniority / Length of Service Calculations** | ❌ Missing | Automatic seniority date derivation from hire date with oracle rule overrides. |

### Key Field-Level Gaps (Worker / Assignment Form)
| Oracle Field | NexusAI Status |
|---|---|
| Person Number / Name (First/Middle/Last) | ✅ |
| Date of Birth | ✅ |
| National Identifier (SSN, NIN) | ⚠️ Exists but no format validation |
| Gender / Pronouns | ⚠️ Gender exists |
| Person Type (Employee / Contingent) | ✅ |
| Legal Employer | ✅ |
| Business Unit | ✅ |
| Department | ✅ |
| Job / Position | ✅ |
| Grade / Step / Grade Ladder | ❌ Missing |
| Assignment Category (Full/Part Time) | ⚠️ |
| Probation End Date | ❌ Missing |
| Effective Start/End Date (DateTrack) | ❌ **CRITICAL** |
| Manager (as of date) | ⚠️ Manager field exists, no DateTrack |
| Work Location | ✅ |
| Working Hours / Schedule | ⚠️ Schedule exists, no FTE calculation |

