## Module 19 — Global Payroll
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Global Payroll / Payroll Connect

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [PayrollEngine.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PayrollEngine.tsx) (5KB) — Run payroll UI
- ✅ [PayrollProcessing.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PayrollProcessing.tsx) (4.7KB)
- ✅ [PayrollRuns.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PayrollRuns.tsx) (2.7KB) — List of payroll runs
- ✅ [PayrollDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PayrollDetail.tsx)
- ✅ `rewards/` sub-directory — 5 pages (payroll, benefits, comp)
- ✅ Schemas: [rewards_payroll.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/rewards_payroll.ts), [hr_payroll_ext.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/hr_payroll_ext.ts)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Payroll Definition Setup** | ⚠️ Partial | Basic payroll run exists. Missing: Pay Frequency (Weekly/Biweekly/Monthly), Cut-Off Date rules, Period number/date auto-generation. |
| **Element Setup & Entry (FastFormula)** | ❌ **CRITICAL** | Oracle uses "Elements" (earnings/deductions) defined with FastFormula rules. Nexus has static payroll components. Missing: A formula-driven element definition UI. |
| **Retro-Pay Engine** | ❌ Missing | If a salary change is backdated 2 months, Oracle auto-calculates the arrears owed and pays in the current period. |
| **Payroll Flow Submission UI** | ⚠️ Partial | PayrollRuns exists. Missing: Full Payroll Flow orchestrator: Calculate → Verify → Prepayments → Archival → Payment → Costing → GL Transfer as discrete steps. |
| **Costing & GL Transfer** | ❌ Missing | Distributing payroll costs across cost centers/departments and posting to the GL. |
| **Tax Filing (Statutory Reports)** | ❌ Missing | W-2, 941, P60, statutory country-specific payroll tax reporting. |
| **Employee Pay Slip PDF** | ⚠️ Partial | PayrollDetail exists. Missing: Formatted PDF pay slip generation with YTD totals, tax breakdown, deduction listing. |
| **Off-Cycle Payment Run** | ❌ Missing | Ad-hoc salary advance or correction payment outside the normal payroll cycle. |
| **Payroll Simulation** | ❌ Missing | Oracle lets payroll managers simulate changes (e.g., "What if I increase John's salary by 10%?") and see the net pay impact before running the actual payroll. |

### Key Field-Level Gaps (PayRun Form)
| Oracle Field | NexusAI Status |
|---|---|
| Payroll Definition | ⚠️ |
| Payroll Period | ✅ |
| Process Date | ✅ |
| Consolidation Group | ❌ Missing |
| Run Type (Regular / Supplemental / Report) | ❌ Missing |
| Element Entry Override | ❌ Missing |
| Retro-Pay Indicator | ❌ Missing |
| GL Cost Allocation (per employee) | ❌ Missing |

