## Module 20 — Time & Labor (WFM)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Fusion Time and Labor / Absence Management

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ `wfm/` sub-directory — **18 pages** (very extensive)
- ✅ [TimesheetManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/TimesheetManagement.tsx) (5.9KB)
- ✅ [TimeAttendance.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/TimeAttendance.tsx)
- ✅ [WorkforceScheduling.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/WorkforceScheduling.tsx) (6.2KB)
- ✅ [LeaveRequest.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/LeaveRequest.tsx) / [LeaveApproval.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/LeaveApproval.tsx) / [LeaveWorkflows.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/LeaveWorkflows.tsx)
- ✅ Schema: [time_labor.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/time_labor.ts) (11.5KB), [time_rules.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/time_rules.ts)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Web Clock / Badge Integration** | ❌ Missing | Oracle Time Collection Devices (TCD): Web clock, physical badge swipe, mobile GPS-based punch. |
| **Time Entry Rules (Overtime / Double-Time)** | ⚠️ Partial | [time_rules.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/time_rules.ts) exists. Missing: The execution engine that applies state/union overtime rules (1.5× after 8 hrs/day, 2× on Sunday) to raw time entries. |
| **Manager Time Approval (Calendar View)** | ⚠️ Partial | Scheduling exists. Missing: Manager-facing weekly calendar where they see all their team's submitted timesheets and can approve/reject individual line items. |
| **Absence Accrual Engine** | ❌ Missing | The FastFormula-driven formula that adds accrual hours to an employee's balance monthly, enforces caps, and calculates carryover at year-end. |
| **FMLA / Leave of Absence Workflow** | ❌ Missing | Oracle has structured leave plan types with FMLA designation, medical certification tracking, and intermittent leave handling. |
| **Shift Bidding** | ❌ Missing | Employees bid on available shifts; managers approve selections. |
| **Time Card Audit Report** | ❌ Missing | Who changed a timecard, when, and from what value to what value. |

