## Module 21 — Recruitment (Taleo / ORC)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Recruiting Cloud (ORC) / Taleo

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ `recruitment/` sub-directory — **13 pages**
- ✅ [RecruitmentManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/RecruitmentManagement.tsx) (6.6KB)
- ✅ [RecruitmentConfiguration.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/RecruitmentConfiguration.tsx) (9.5KB) — Significant config page
- ✅ `recruiting/` sub-directory — 2 pages
- ✅ Schema: [talent_recruitment.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/talent_recruitment.ts) (9.1KB — Requisitions, Candidates, Offers, Interviews)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Career Site Builder** | ❌ Missing | Oracle ORC provides a branded, public-facing career page builder with custom sections. Job postings publish directly from the requisition. |
| **Interview Scoring Rubrics** | ⚠️ Partial | Interview records exist. Missing: Structured interview guide with per-competency scoring (1–5 scale), automated consensus scoring panel view. |
| **Offer Letter Generator (PDF)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle generates a formatted PDF offer letter from HR metadata (salary, start date, position) using a BI Publisher template. |
| **AI Resume Parsing** | ❌ Missing | Oracle ORC uses ML to parse resumes and auto-populate candidate profile fields (Skills, Education, Experience). |
| **Job Posting (External Boards)** | ⚠️ Partial | Posting concept exists. Missing: Direct integration with LinkedIn, Indeed, Glassdoor via standardized job feed. |
| **Candidate Merge / Duplicate Detection** | ❌ Missing | Same candidate applying multiple times — Oracle detects and merges profiles. |
| **Requisition Approval Rules** | ⚠️ Partial | Basic approval exists. Missing: AME-style rules (e.g., VP-level approval required if salary band is Sr. Director+). |
| **Onboarding Checklist Assignment** | ⚠️ Partial | [OnboardingAutomation.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/OnboardingAutomation.tsx) exists. Missing: Auto-assignment of onboarding task checklists when an offer is accepted (IT setup, badge, document signing). |

