## Module 22 — Performance Management
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Performance Management Cloud

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [PerformanceManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PerformanceManagement.tsx) (5KB)
- ✅ [PerformanceReviews.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PerformanceReviews.tsx) (4.7KB)
- ✅ [PerformanceConfiguration.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PerformanceConfiguration.tsx) (3.1KB)
- ✅ Schema: [talent_performance.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/talent_performance.ts) — Goals, Documents, Feedback

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Performance Document Template Builder** | ⚠️ Partial | Config exists. Missing: Oracle's template designer with Section types (Goals, Competencies, Summary Rating), eligibility profiles, and rating model selector. |
| **Goal Cascading Engine** | ❌ Missing | Oracle's goal cascade allows VP to create a goal, manager aligns a child goal, employee aligns a grandchild goal — forming a purpose hierarchy tree. |
| **Calibration Session UI** | ❌ Missing | Managers gather in a calibration room view — a 9-box style grid where they can drag employees between rating cells and discuss. |
| **Document Routing State Machine** | ❌ Missing | Oracle's performance document has strict states: Not Started → Worker Self-Evaluation → Manager Evaluation → Manager Meeting → Approval → Complete. |
| **360-Degree Feedback Request** | ⚠️ Partial | Feedback schema exists. Missing: Anonymous feedback request lifecycle (invite → deadline tracking → results revealed only to manager). |
| **Performance Rating Integration → Compensation** | ❌ Missing | Oracle uses the performance rating as an input to the merit matrix in the Compensation Workbench. |

