## Module 24 — Succession Planning
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Succession Management

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [SuccessionPlanning.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SuccessionPlanning.tsx) (**33KB** — most comprehensive in talent suite)
