| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **9-Box Interactive Grid (Performance vs. Potential)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle's graphical 9-box lets managers drag employee icons between quadrants. Nexus renders succession data in tables. |
| **Succession Org Chart Overlay** | ❌ Missing | Oracle overlays primary/secondary successors on top of the organizational chart with readiness indicators. |
| **Talent Pool Management** | ✅ Good — [SuccessionPlanning.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SuccessionPlanning.tsx) is comprehensive |
