## Module 25 — Compensation & Benefits
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Compensation + Oracle Benefits

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [CompensationManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/CompensationManagement.tsx) (4.5KB)
- ✅ `rewards/` sub-directory — 5 pages
- ✅ Schema: [rewards_compensation.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/rewards_compensation.ts), [rewards_benefits.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/rewards_benefits.ts)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Workforce Compensation Workbench (Merit Budget)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle's most complex HCM UI: Manager sees all their reports in a budget table. They can drag merit % sliders and the remaining budget pool updates in real-time. |
| **Compensation Plan Definition (Eligibility Profiles)** | ❌ Missing | Rules engine determining which employees are eligible for which plan (e.g., "Full-time employees with 1+ year tenure"). |
| **Benefits Open Enrollment Shopping Wizard** | ❌ Missing | Oracle's multi-step enrollment wizard: Select medical plan → Select dependents → Select dental → Summary. |
| **Life Event Processing** | ❌ Missing | Triggering benefit re-enrollment options when a life event occurs (marriage, new child, divorce). |
| **Salary Ranges / Grade Hierarchy** | ❌ Missing | Oracle maps grades to salary bands. CompaRatio = Employee Salary / Band Midpoint. |
| **Stock / Equity Awards** | ❌ Missing | Oracle tracks RSUs, ISO, NQSO grants and vesting schedules. |
| **Total Compensation Statement** | ❌ Missing | A PDF statement showing employees the full value of their compensation (base + bonus + benefits + equity). |

